{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261122/photo/bkn-20261122050047829-1122_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261122061058\"/><p>救援人員入內進行調查。(梁國雄攝)</p><p>灣仔發生火警。今日(22日)清晨4時53分，執法部門接獲多人報案，指謝斐道388號地下一間小菜館冒出大量濃煙，曾傳出兩爆炸聲。救援人員接報到場，人員需打破玻璃門開喉入內灌救，至清晨5時28分已將火救熄，事件中毋須疏散，幸未有傷亡報告，起火原因有待調查中。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T22:19:16.794262+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":153,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T21:00:47+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T22:12:43.192052+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T22:12:43.192052+00:00","content_hash":"2eb35bc03ba3147663f168540bbcb4158d80e37b4522ed43c5e20f2d344ba834","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}